<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>LeadRelay — WhatsApp Leads, Effortlessly</title>
    <style>
        @@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=Fraunces:wght@600;700&family=Caveat:wght@600&display=swap");

        :root {
            --bg: #0f1221;
            --bg-soft: #151a2f;
            --ink: #f7f6f2;
            --muted: #c9c6bf;
            --accent: #ffb454;
            --accent-2: #7ee3c8;
            --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            --stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--ink);
            font-family: "DM Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% -10%, rgba(255, 180, 84, 0.25), transparent 60%),
                radial-gradient(900px 500px at 100% 0%, rgba(126, 227, 200, 0.2), transparent 60%),
                linear-gradient(180deg, #0d1020, #12162a 60%, #0f1221);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
        .wrap { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 80px; }

        header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .brand-badge {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffb454, #ff6f6f);
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #1b1b1b;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        }

        .nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 18px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .hero {
            margin-top: 64px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--accent-2);
            background: rgba(126, 227, 200, 0.12);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(126, 227, 200, 0.25);
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
            font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4rem);
            line-height: 1.02;
            margin: 16px 0;
        }

        p.lede {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            max-width: 520px;
        }

        .cta-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-top: 26px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 12px 18px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .btn-ghost {
            border-color: var(--stroke);
            color: var(--ink);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        }

        .hero-card {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
            padding: 24px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        }

        .pill {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .steps {
            display: grid;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }

        .step {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .step-number {
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
        }

        .grid {
            margin-top: 64px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .feature {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--stroke);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 18px;
        }

        .feature h3 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        .feature p {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .cta-banner {
            margin-top: 72px;
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 180, 84, 0.2), rgba(126, 227, 200, 0.2));
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .widget-callout {
            margin-top: 48px;
            position: relative;
            padding: 22px 24px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            display: grid;
            gap: 8px;
        }


        footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        @@media (max-width: 720px) {
            header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
            .nav { flex-wrap: wrap; }
            
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
    <header>
        <div class="brand">
            <div class="brand-badge">LR</div>
            <span>LeadRelay</span>
        </div>
        <nav class="nav">
            <a href="#how">How it works</a>
            <a href="#features">Features</a>
            <a href="/owner/login">Owner login</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">WhatsApp leads, minus the fuss</span>
            <h1>Turn “Hi” into qualified leads — without a complicated CRM.</h1>
            <p class="lede">
                LeadRelay drops a friendly WhatsApp button onto your site, starts a warm, guided chat,
                and emails you the details you actually need. Made for indie businesses that move fast.
            </p>
            <div class="cta-row">
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#how">Try the widget</a>
                <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#features">See what’s inside</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-card">
            <div class="pill">Live demo conversation</div>
            <div class="steps">
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">1</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Customer:</strong> “Hi! I need help with a kitchen remodel.”
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">2</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>LeadRelay:</strong> “Amazing — what’s your name and email?”
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>You:</strong> Receive a tidy lead email with the key details.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="widget-callout">
        <strong>Meta demo: the widget is live on this page</strong>
        <span style="color:var(--muted);">Click the WhatsApp button in the corner to try it here.</span>
    </div>

    <section id="how" class="grid">
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>1. Paste the script</h3>
            <p>Drop a single script tag onto your site. Done.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>2. Friendly chat flow</h3>
            <p>Ask only what you need — name, email, project info, anything.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>3. Get the lead</h3>
            <p>Receive a clean, readable lead summary in your inbox.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>4. Follow up fast</h3>
            <p>Reply in WhatsApp or hop on a call while interest is hot.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features" class="grid">
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>Per‑site questions</h3>
            <p>Interior design? Marketing? Coaching? Tailor the questions per site.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>Domain allow‑list</h3>
            <p>Keep your widget tied to approved domains.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>AI‑ready</h3>
            <p>Plug in an AI responder when you’re ready to go beyond scripted flows.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>Local debug mode</h3>
            <p>Test the chat flow without WhatsApp or Meta setup.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="cta-banner">
        <div>
            <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;">Start a friendlier lead capture flow</h2>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);">Want the widget on your own site? We can set you up in minutes.</div>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#how">See how it works</a>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <span>LeadRelay — built for indie teams.</span>
        <span>Questions? hello@leadrelay.dev</span>
    </footer>
</div>

<script src="/widget/bootstrap.js?siteId=site_demo"></script>
</body>
</html>
